orca_stuff/**/*smd_h2o*
orca_stuff/**/*debug_info*

# computational/ -- the curated, permanent home for the C1-C10 register's
# calculations (COMPUTATIONAL.md), as opposed to orca_stuff/'s raw homelab
# staging import. Same "outputs stay homelab-local, only .inp/.xyz are
# tracked" policy as above; gitignore has no brace-expansion, so the same
# ~55 patterns are repeated here rather than shared. Keep the two lists in
# sync if either changes. Deliberately does NOT extend to uvvis/, which
# tracks its ORCA outputs in full by prior, separate decision.
computational/**/*.out
computational/**/*.gbw
computational/**/*.gbw1
computational/**/*.gbw2
computational/**/*.loc
computational/**/*.ges
computational/**/*.densities
computational/**/*.densitiesinfo
